        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIR ANDREW.\nNay, let him alone, I’ll go another way to work with him. I’ll have an action of battery against him, if there be any law in Illyria. Though I struck him first, yet it’s no matter for that.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
