      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "OLIVIA.\nWill it be ever thus? Ungracious wretch,\nFit for the mountains and the barbarous caves,\nWhere manners ne’er were preach’d! Out of my sight!\nBe not offended, dear Cesario.\nRudesby, be gone!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
