      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SEBASTIAN.\nWhat relish is in this? How runs the stream?\nOr I am mad, or else this is a dream.\nLet fancy still my sense in Lethe steep;\nIf it be thus to dream, still let me sleep!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
